  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8de87c9504c95a2a",
      "translationZh": "简而言之：当工作以读取为主，而且能拆分成彼此独立的部分时，使用并行智能体：例如研究、搜索、审查大量文件。每个工作智能体都构建自己的上下文，彼此不会冲突。当工作是一条连续的决策链时，使用单个按顺序执行的智能体：例如编程、写作，以及任何第 N 步依赖第 N-1 步所做选择的工作。所有实测结果都表明，并行会让这些任务的表现变差，而不是变好。而且，即便并行能胜出，也要保持团队规模较小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22b428c5c5b25b74",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic：“我们如何构建多智能体研究系统”（2025 年 6 月）https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/multi-agent-research-system",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c18c7519fc01e58f",
      "translationZh": "在他们的内部研究评测中，多智能体研究系统的表现比单个智能体高出 90.2%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64d1f08a7a94bae0",
      "translationZh": "成本：多智能体运行消耗的 token 数约为普通聊天的 15 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9493ca25277fa626",
      "translationZh": "他们自己也提醒：与研究相比，编程“涉及的真正可并行化的任务更少”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca292efb0c7f07f9",
      "translationZh": "LangChain，Harrison Chase：“如何以及何时构建多智能体系统”（2025 年 6 月）https://www.langchain.com/blog/how-and-when-to-build-multi-agent-systems",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "049eccd2af7b88b8",
      "translationZh": "读取任务可以并行，写入任务不应并行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4147e599b1c68b53",
      "translationZh": "支持顺序执行的理由",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b864a793388e96f9",
      "translationZh": "Nature Machine Intelligence：《能力强大的语言模型可能不再受益于协作》（2026年7月）https://www.nature.com/articles/s42256-026-01268-y",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "deb21d5b3f239458",
      "translationZh": "经过同行评审，涵盖260种受控配置：每一种多智能体变体都使编程结果变差（在SWE-bench Verified上下降−1.3%至−12.8%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "84db08c63031cce5",
      "translationZh": "当单智能体基线超过约45%时，多智能体的增益变为零或负值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "771f44121a50e209",
      "translationZh": "在没有集中式验证的情况下，错误放大达到17.2倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b80dd6d63d1f3ee",
      "translationZh": "UC Berkeley（MAST）：《多智能体LLM系统为何失败？》（NeurIPS 2025）https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.13657",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5691375c6371bc91",
      "translationZh": "在7个流行的多智能体框架中，测得的失败率为41–86.7%（基于1,642条真实轨迹）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ffd4d876d0744540",
      "translationZh": "失败源于设计和协调缺陷，而非模型的能力限制。标准协议未能解决这些问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d99d922861d46f3c",
      "translationZh": "包含代码和轨迹的仓库：https://github.com/multi-agent-systems-failure-taxonomy/MAST",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "632134c866f6b8fd",
      "translationZh": "Cognition，Walden Yan：《不要构建多智能体》（2025年6月）https://cognition.com/blog/dont-build-multi-agents",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b85a8ee6e52a392",
      "translationZh": "上下文被拆分的并行工作智能体会各自作出相互矛盾的隐含决策，在合并时发生冲突",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1603281b531b3819",
      "translationZh": "他们的答案：一个单线程智能体加上上下文压缩。Devin 就是这样工作的",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f36496131692ee5",
      "translationZh": "《在相同的思考词元预算下，单智能体 LLM 在多跳推理上的表现优于多智能体系统》（arXiv，2026年4月）https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.02460",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "368e6c872f17446d",
      "translationZh": "给双方相同的词元预算，单个智能体的表现就能与团队持平或超过团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "daf5f4de8567297b",
      "translationZh": "只有当单个智能体的上下文质量被降低时，多智能体才会胜出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16318a5d6ae7b2b2",
      "translationZh": "普林斯顿大学，Kapoor 等人：《真正有用的 AI 智能体》（TMLR 2025）https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.01502",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5586b5c0ab2b566",
      "translationZh": "复杂的多智能体配置成本最高可达约 100 倍，却只能达到简单基线方案已经实现的相同准确率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "603f3433d723a8d8",
      "translationZh": "简单的基线方案形成帕累托支配：成本更低，而且效果同样好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76c3f68bb8bc7751",
      "translationZh": "OpenHands，Graham Neubig：《别小看单智能体系统》（2024 年 9 月）https://www.openhands.dev/blog/dont-sleep-on-single-agent-systems",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ab06707d58f6804",
      "translationZh": "一个强大的通用型智能体，就能满足人们构建多智能体系统所要实现的大部分需求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "575ec19ea7b40689",
      "translationZh": "只有在确实需要隔离或职责分离时，才采用多智能体方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5adf26f563127ef",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/PilgrimofHaqq2 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
